'''Mighty Carrowsell''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was introduced in [[Version 11.8 Update|Version 11.8]], and can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Frontline Assault IRON LEGION (Gacha Event)|Frontline Assault IRON LEGION]] and [[Colossus Busters (Gacha Event)|Colossus Busters]] events. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 13.2 Update|Version 13.2]] increases damage and gains the [[Resistant]] ability. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 15.4 Update|Version 15.4]].

