==Trivia==
*Mighty Carrowsell is based on the common myth of [[wikipedia:Cattle mutilation#Aliens|cows being abducted by aliens]], which comes from rumors of cows mysteriously disappearing without a trace.
*While Mighty Carrowsell's [[Cat Guide]] description states it has [[Omni Strike]], its first hit&mdash;targetting ranges 1~401&mdash;is [[Long Distance]].
**The reason is likely due to the fact that Mighty Carrowsell's second and third hits are actually Omni Strike.

